1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,320
Ayi is a 22-year-old girl from Kashgar, Xinjiang.
阿依是一个22岁的女孩，来自新疆喀什。

2
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:13,570
She became well-known in a new season of a TV programme, which tells people how young people build their careers after leaving school.
她在一档电视节目的新一季中出了名，这档节目向人们讲述年轻人走出校门后如何开创自己的事业。

3
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:19,970
The programme followed 12 students who studied Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM).
这档节目跟拍了12名学习中医（TCM）的学生。

4
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:23,980
As the youngest one, Ayi at first was unnoticed.
作为其中年纪最小的学生，阿依起初并不引人注意。

5
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,160
By the end of the season, however, she surprised all with her great progress.
然而，到这一季结束时，她以巨大的进步让所有人都大吃一惊。

6
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:32,220
Ayi was not from a family of doctors.
阿依并不是出身于医生家庭。

7
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:37,510
Her earliest interest in traditional medicine was awakened in her old town.
她对传统医学的兴趣，最早是在老家被唤起的。

8
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:44,280
In that place, people believed mutton soup cured illness faster than seeing doctors in hospital.
在那里，人们相信羊肉汤治病比去医院看医生更快。

9
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:50,080
When her grandmother died of illness, she realized good doctors were needed in that place.
奶奶因病去世时，她意识到那里需要好医生。

10
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:54,460
That was when she decided to become one to serve the people there.
就在那时，她决定成为一名好医生，为那里的人们服务。

11
00:00:55,260 --> 00:01:03,530
In 2018, thanks to an education programme for Xinjiang middle school students, Ayi had a chance to study in a Shenzhen high school.
2018年，得益于一项面向新疆初中生的教育项目，阿依有机会到深圳的一所高中读书。

12
00:01:04,330 --> 00:01:09,590
Three years later, she was accepted by Guangzhou University of Chinese Medicine.
三年后，她被广州中医药大学录取。

13
00:01:10,390 --> 00:01:14,480
However, the road to becoming a TCM doctor was never easy.
然而，成为一名中医的道路从来都不好走。

14
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:20,480
For her, it was especially difficult to understand ancient Chinese medical books.
对她来说，读懂中国古代的医书尤其困难。

15
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:24,740
“Terms, like yin and yang, were a totally new way of thinking.
“像阴阳这样的术语，是一种全新的思维方式。

16
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:28,810
So I was always half a step behind my classmates,” Ayi said.
所以我总是比同学们落后半步。”阿依说。

17
00:01:29,610 --> 00:01:34,140
To catch up, she put in more time and developed a study method of her own.
为了迎头赶上，她投入了更多的时间，并形成了一套自己的学习方法。

18
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:41,950
Along with her schoolwork, Ayi got practical experience by taking part in more than 13 volunteer activities.
除了学业之外，阿依还通过参加超过13项志愿活动，获得了实践经验。

19
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:48,810
Ayi’s greatest dream is to return to Xinjiang and use her TCM knowledge to serve local people.
阿依最大的梦想是回到新疆，用自己的中医知识为当地人服务。

20
00:01:49,610 --> 00:01:59,970
“Back in Kashgar, I know many people don’t look for medical care, so I believe it’s deeply meaningful to use TCM, which is simple and cheap and works well,” Ayi said.
“我知道，在喀什老家，很多人生了病也不去看医生，所以我相信，用中医非常有意义——中医简单、便宜，而且效果很好。”阿依说。
